        }
    }","notes":"deposit(100) previously always reverted (ok:false) because the body ended in revert(); now it performs the deposit: paused check and min (store_c=1) checks kept, then mints net of fee (fee = 100*100/10000 = 1, net = 99) to msg.sender, raising balanceOf to 0x44b (1000+99) and totalSupply/var_c to 0x44b, matching observations 1-3 and getStats (balance, totalSupply, fee=100, paused=0). deposit_below_min (arg0=0 < store_c=1) still reverts via require, preserving that probe. Removed the trailing revert and the view/pure conflict by making it non-view since it writes state; signature/visibility unchanged."}
